 "structural_change": "QKO-HROOT2 10-21 (INGEST split): single-clock engine leaf of the split qkd_hr_ingest_qm. Source = the native32 primitive copy qkd_host_native_engine_n32 (Codex codex/k-hroot-integrated-1021, sha256 38376238deffb134..., census max 32, 34 reset / 2 in_v / 3 done_v port copies) in wrapper qkd_hr_ingest_eng: 34 kept engine-region reset leaves, KW=20 kept (not dont_touch) BUF copies of w_v for the shell request-word chunks, done_v__c1 BUF copy; RMW_EN 0 read face tied exactly as the CDC fork (r_rdy/rd_v/rd_data 0). Signed off at the ingest period 1666.667 ps (route 1540). FALLBACK 432x432 (e3b geometry, single ck_ingest root): 4 bank columns x 8 rows (75.6 x 43.2 lattice, E gap 24 um), 130 um W std band, W face 432 um (2.9 pins/um).",
